144
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's saved...</font>

145
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:07,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think the enemy attacks
would cancel each other out...</font>

146
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:10,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was super lucky...</font>

147
00:10:10,170 --> 00:10:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What're you doing, Naruto?!</font>

148
00:10:12,590 --> 00:10:15,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What kind of idiot
would attempt</font>

149
00:10:15,170 --> 00:10:16,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to cast a Jutsu directly
in front of an opponent?!</font>

150
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:18,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

151
00:10:18,590 --> 00:10:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The essence of a Shinobi is deception.
How you deceive your opponent.</font>

152
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even casting one Jutsu,
you avoid the eyes of your opponents,</font>

153
00:10:26,770 --> 00:10:29,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">catch them off balance,
and outsmart them...</font>

154
00:10:31,020 --> 00:10:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The way you made your entrance earlier,
that's just you coming to be a target...</font>

155
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:38,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No.</font>

156
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I went to the trouble
of coming to the rescue.</font>

157
00:10:41,530 --> 00:10:43,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What concerns me more than that is...</font>

158
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:50,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy...</font>

159
00:10:52,170 --> 00:10:54,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku... What's the idea?</font>

160
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza-san, leave this kid to me...</font>

161
00:10:59,260 --> 00:11:02,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please let me fight this battle my way.</font>

162
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:04,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say...?</font>

163
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:40,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you mean no interfering... Haku?</font>

164
00:11:43,390 --> 00:11:46,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're naive... as usual...</font>

165
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

166
00:11:50,770 --> 00:11:51,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naive, eh...</font>

167
00:11:52,730 --> 00:11:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True enough...</font>

168
00:11:54,940 --> 00:11:56,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Judging from these wounds,</font>

169
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:58,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no mistaking that
I was attacked with a Senbon.</font>

170
00:11:59,490 --> 00:12:02,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But no vital areas have
been targeted so far.</font>

171
00:12:07,530 --> 00:12:09,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does he mean to half-kill me...?</font>

172
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so!</font>

173
00:12:12,250 --> 00:12:15,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me, I'll take you out first, so...!</font>

174
00:12:18,170 --> 00:12:21,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible.
It's too much for Naruto!</font>

175
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:23,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should be the one to...</font>

176
00:12:23,970 --> 00:12:27,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey. Don't get any ideas...</font>

177
00:12:27,930 --> 00:12:29,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you move,</font>

178
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:32,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you know what'll happen
to that old man, right?</font>

179
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True...</font>

180
00:12:36,060 --> 00:12:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I move away from here and
head towards Naruto,</font>

181
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:42,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza will kill Tazuna-san.</font>

182
00:12:43,030 --> 00:12:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way can Sakura completely
protect him by herself.</font>

183
00:12:46,370 --> 00:12:48,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it?</font>

184
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:53,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's just see how those young guys
fight against each other.</font>

185
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:56,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That mask...</font>

186
00:12:56,580 --> 00:12:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were Zabuza's comrade, after all,
weren't you!</font>

187
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:02,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got nerve to deceive us!</font>

188
00:13:04,220 --> 00:13:05,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry.</font>

189
00:13:06,390 --> 00:13:09,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, your teacher also said it,
didn't he?</font>

190
00:13:09,810 --> 00:13:13,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things like deceiving and
catching one off guard is a Shinobi's duty.</font>

191
00:13:14,100 --> 00:13:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't take it personally.</font>

192
00:13:19,060 --> 00:13:22,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have that luxury, either!</font>

193
00:13:25,990 --> 00:13:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

194
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:29,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke?</font>

195
00:13:30,530 --> 00:13:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't... forgotten about you.</font>

196
00:13:35,660 --> 00:13:39,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I thought he had disappeared...
but he was there...</font>

197
00:13:40,790 --> 00:13:45,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would rather you had
just gone down quietly.</font>

198
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:47,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it looks like it won't work
that way.</font>

199
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine. I'll put an end to it first.</font>

200
00:13:52,060 --> 00:13:54,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey!</font>

201
00:13:55,270 --> 00:13:58,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun. I'll get to you later.</font>

202
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's with him...?</font>

203
00:14:06,030 --> 00:14:06,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is it!</font>

204
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the real body is over there, eh...</font>

205
00:14:16,710 --> 00:14:17,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

206
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:19,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm over here.</font>

207
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:26,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He moved...? How?!</font>

208
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Sasuke-kun!
— Sasuke!</font>

209
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that just now?!</font>

210
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:53,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke's body suddenly got battered...</font>

211
00:14:54,330 --> 00:14:56,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's he doing it?!</font>

212
00:15:03,130 --> 00:15:05,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of Jutsu is he using...?</font>

213
00:15:06,050 --> 00:15:09,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's conceivable that he has clones
hide in the mirrors and</font>

214
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:12,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">gets them all to throw
the Senbons simultaneously...</font>

215
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:14,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, they're too fast considering...</font>

216
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:15,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does it mean...</font>

217
00:15:15,930 --> 00:15:17,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not being able to see even
the trajectory of the weapons...?</font>

218
00:15:20,730 --> 00:15:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, if it's a mere Clone Jutsu...</font>

219
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:27,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't see a reason for
these ice mirrors...</font>

220
00:15:30,490 --> 00:15:35,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case, there's no way to question
that these mirrors are pivotal for his attacks.</font>

221
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:43,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I can do is to launch attacks...</font>

222
00:15:43,330 --> 00:15:45,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from both the outside and inside.</font>

223
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thing to do is to figure out
the meaning of the mirror!</font>

224
00:15:49,130 --> 00:15:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of here!</font>

225
00:15:56,430 --> 00:15:58,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All there is to do is...</font>

226
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:03,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for me to attack the inside and have Naruto
try attacking the mirrors from the outside.</font>

227
00:16:04,230 --> 00:16:06,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo! I came to save you.</font>

228
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:10,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You okay, Sasuke?</font>

229
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:12,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

230
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What good will it do you
to catch your ally off guard...?</font>

231
00:16:16,370 --> 00:16:18,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You idiot!</font>

232
00:16:18,870 --> 00:16:21,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're a Shinobi,
you'll move more cautiously!</font>

233
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:23,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with you?!</font>

234
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:25,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came to the rescue, you know!</font>

235
00:16:25,630 --> 00:16:27,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you also come inside the mirrors...</font>

236
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! I've had it, you idiot!</font>

237
00:16:31,260 --> 00:16:33,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot?
What do you mean by idiot?!</font>

238
00:16:34,090 --> 00:16:37,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As to be expected of the
number one unpredictable Ninja.</font>

239
00:16:37,550 --> 00:16:41,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is making the situation worse and
worse by coming to aid.</font>

240
00:16:42,140 --> 00:16:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it's come to this,
all that is left is to smash the mirrors!</font>

241
00:16:46,060 --> 00:16:46,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style!</font>

242
00:16:47,060 --> 00:16:48,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What're you going to do?!</font>

243
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:51,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are mirrors made
with freezing water...</font>

244
00:16:51,940 --> 00:16:53,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so...</font>

245
00:16:53,150 --> 00:16:54,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fireball Jutsu!</font>

246
00:17:08,380 --> 00:17:10,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not working at all!</font>

247
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:13,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They won't melt with that
level of firepower.</font>

248
00:17:28,060 --> 00:17:32,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Where'd he attack from?!
Is it the clones?</font>

249
00:17:35,820 --> 00:17:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's the real body?!</font>

250
00:17:38,700 --> 00:17:41,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's useless for you to even
attempt following with your eyes.</font>

251
00:17:41,410 --> 00:17:43,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely will not be caught.</font>

252
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:46,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph. Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

253
00:17:46,710 --> 00:17:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't!</font>

254
00:17:49,670 --> 00:17:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so, I'll find out which is
the real body by hitting them all!</font>

255
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:21,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a teleportation Jutsu that uses
mirrors that can reflect only my image.</font>

256
00:18:22,030 --> 00:18:23,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watching you from the speed I move,</font>

257
00:18:23,870 --> 00:18:26,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it almost seems as if
you aren't moving at all...</font>

258
00:18:27,870 --> 00:18:29,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it!</font>

259
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:31,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that Jutsu... the Kekkei Genkai?!</font>

260
00:18:34,460 --> 00:18:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kekkei... Genkai...?</font>

261
00:18:37,260 --> 00:18:39,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the same type as my Sharingan...</font>

262
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:44,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Deep blood ties...
Lineage of paranormal individuals...</font>

263
00:18:45,770 --> 00:18:48,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A type of Jutsu that is passed on
only through those traits...</font>

264
00:18:48,850 --> 00:18:50,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...!</font>

265
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

266
00:18:51,730 --> 00:18:55,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible even for me
to copy that Jutsu...</font>

267
00:18:56,650 --> 00:18:58,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there's no way to destroy
that Jutsu, either!</font>

268
00:19:03,030 --> 00:19:04,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

269
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:08,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... what?!</font>

270
00:19:08,960 --> 00:19:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't die here yet.</font>

271
00:19:12,250 --> 00:19:15,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">'Cause I have a dream
that I must turn into reality...</font>

272
00:19:15,750 --> 00:19:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The dream to have my strength recognized
by everyone in the village...</font>

273
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:21,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and become the Hokage!</font>

274
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:24,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dream...</font>

275
00:19:43,820 --> 00:19:45,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pathetic brat.</font>

276
00:19:53,170 --> 00:19:56,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brats like you aren't needed
by anyone</font>

277
00:19:56,960 --> 00:20:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and die without ever knowing
any freedom or dreams...</font>

278
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:07,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have the same eyes as I do...</font>

279
00:20:13,520 --> 00:20:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For me, becoming a Shinobi completely
is difficult.</font>

280
00:20:18,530 --> 00:20:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can, I don't want to kill you guys...</font>

281
00:20:22,110 --> 00:20:24,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I don't want to get killed
by you guys...</font>

282
00:20:26,030 --> 00:20:28,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if you guys are
going to come at me...</font>

283
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:33,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill my feelings with a sword and
completely become a Shinobi.</font>

284
00:20:33,870 --> 00:20:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This bridge is the battleground
that connects each of us to our dreams.</font>

285
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, for the sake of my dream.</font>

286
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you, for the sake of your dreams.</font>

287
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:46,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't hold it against me...</font>

288
00:20:48,050 --> 00:20:50,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to protect the person dear to me...</font>

289
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:55,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I work for the sake of that person,
I fight for that person,</font>

290
00:20:55,940 --> 00:20:58,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I want to make that
person's dream a reality...</font>

291
00:20:58,440 --> 00:21:00,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my dream.</font>

292
00:21:00,360 --> 00:21:03,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the sake of the dream,
I will completely become a Shinobi...</font>

293
00:21:03,860 --> 00:21:06,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and kill you guys!</font>

294
00:21:33,360 --> 00:21:36,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

295
00:21:36,740 --> 00:21:40,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

296
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:43,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

297
00:21:43,370 --> 00:21:47,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

298
00:21:50,550 --> 00:21:53,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

299
